{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/f210a220fb7360739b281ef9d47212d8.avif?t=1760880816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras_big/f210a220fb7360739b281ef9d47212d8.webp?t=1760880816 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hallow Maze is a soulslike metroidvania, set in the fantasy world of the\u00a0 Nightlands, a place where no sun reaches its surface.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war has fallen upon these lands, and mysterious symptoms of a very old disease has been affecting the soldiers, turning them aggresive or even worse, into flesh monsters ravaging castles and caverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/ba724eb4c94e81524c278110212a007c.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player will have the hability to morph into different creatures with different habilities. The bat for air mobility, the GOAT for incredible staggering damage, the seahorse for accessing the deep waters. All transfomations help the player both in exploration and in combat, with the possibility of also upgrading them to a more powerful tier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/9733610c6e290c6a59554eeb40d96688.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player also has the &quot;tools&quot;, powerful forms of energy that create different purposes, like the flamethrower, the energy orb(a bomb), a bow and arrow and many more! Every tool has also its own hability tree so you can upgrade them having in mind every person playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/23acc24edee6b92017cb98c4121b2fd6.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Personalization of a build doesn't end on tools and transformations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have the Hallows which partially give the name to the game. these are artifacts with powerful passives that you can equip to define more your build!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/34793ee04856d7ba94a171ae5ada459a.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story delves into the two main characters, the player, who is the last survivor of the massacre of his family and must avenge them for the sake of their honor, and Moon, a ghostly apparition of a child that doesn't remember how it died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both must help eachother in order to complete the goals of both characters that in turn will develop a real friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/28d9431e750e76550e0ca5d99069d70c.avif?t=1760880816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras_big/28d9431e750e76550e0ca5d99069d70c.avif?t=1760880816 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of the Nightlands is full of obscurity and dangers, and the most difficult challenges come in the shape of bosses. Find these bosses and become stronger in a game colored with vibrant ecosystems and incredible palaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/381f22317b0b2f17ef461748b4fe1250.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508560?t=1760880816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508560?t=1760880816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/e6c99232e3b8a6379ef959e8be715c91f33226b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760880816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/e6c99232e3b8a6379ef959e8be715c91f33226b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760880816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3666690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/f210a220fb7360739b281ef9d47212d8.avif?t=1760880816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras_big/f210a220fb7360739b281ef9d47212d8.webp?t=1760880816 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hallow Maze is a soulslike metroidvania, set in the fantasy world of the\u00a0 Nightlands, a place where no sun reaches its surface.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A war has fallen upon these lands, and mysterious symptoms of a very old disease has been affecting the soldiers, turning them aggresive or even worse, into flesh monsters ravaging castles and caverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/ba724eb4c94e81524c278110212a007c.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player will have the hability to morph into different creatures with different habilities. The bat for air mobility, the GOAT for incredible staggering damage, the seahorse for accessing the deep waters. All transfomations help the player both in exploration and in combat, with the possibility of also upgrading them to a more powerful tier.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/9733610c6e290c6a59554eeb40d96688.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The player also has the &quot;tools&quot;, powerful forms of energy that create different purposes, like the flamethrower, the energy orb(a bomb), a bow and arrow and many more! Every tool has also its own hability tree so you can upgrade them having in mind every person playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/23acc24edee6b92017cb98c4121b2fd6.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Personalization of a build doesn't end on tools and transformations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also have the Hallows which partially give the name to the game. these are artifacts with powerful passives that you can equip to define more your build!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/34793ee04856d7ba94a171ae5ada459a.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The story delves into the two main characters, the player, who is the last survivor of the massacre of his family and must avenge them for the sake of their honor, and Moon, a ghostly apparition of a child that doesn't remember how it died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both must help eachother in order to complete the goals of both characters that in turn will develop a real friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/28d9431e750e76550e0ca5d99069d70c.avif?t=1760880816\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras_big/28d9431e750e76550e0ca5d99069d70c.avif?t=1760880816 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of the Nightlands is full of obscurity and dangers, and the most difficult challenges come in the shape of bosses. Find these bosses and become stronger in a game colored with vibrant ecosystems and incredible palaces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/381f22317b0b2f17ef461748b4fe1250.avif?t=1760880816\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Solcom Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/55ec5a5b7407dac922e44273848947bd0e309dca/header.jpg?t=1760880816","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3508560/855558/ee1cf0abc212ad85a6fc5d058955e322cf48a97f/1750856857/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742566910","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3508560/855558/ee1cf0abc212ad85a6fc5d058955e322cf48a97f/1750856857/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742566910","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3508560/855558/ee1cf0abc212ad85a6fc5d058955e322cf48a97f/1750856857/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742566910","id":257117234,"name":"Hallow Maze Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117234/0ad8af363f166d9b3204dc07109e38ff006f197a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742566910"}],"name":"Hallow Maze","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Solcom Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"1